{__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=",__typename:"NoteTweet",text:"Outbound = ICP + narrative + timing.\n\nRoniesha Copeland (@vercel), says AI transformed what outbound means. The data layer is now actionable, timing is precise, and narrative has a new meaning altogether. It's not about crafting a message, it's about matching it to a moment.\n\nThe problem is early teams skip straight to narrative before the data foundations are in place. Without ICP and intent first, you spend the next year retrofitting a system built to acquire the wrong customers.",entity_set:$R[1400]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set":$R[1401]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[1402]={__refs:$R[1403]=[]},symbols:$R[1404]={__refs:$R[1405]=[]},smarttags:$R[1406]={__refs:$R[1407]=[]},urls:$R[1408]={__refs:$R[1409]=[]},user_mentions:$R[1410]={__refs:$R[1411]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set:user_mentions:0"]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set:user_mentions:0":$R[1412]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcwOTc5NDEyMTU1MTg3MjE=:entity_set:user_mentions:0",__typename:"ApiMentionEntity",indices:$R[1413]=[57,64],is_unmentioned:null,screen_name:"vercel"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[1414]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==:edit_control":$R[1415]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==:edit_control",__typename:"EditControlInitial",edit_tweet_ids:$R[1416]=["2057097941324636251"]},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==:quick_promote_eligibility":$R[1417]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzA5Nzk0MTMyNDYzNjI1MQ==